Package: CABNB
Title: Compositionality-Aware Bias-Corrected Negative Binomial Model
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("Noriaki", "Sato",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "nori@hgc.jp")
Author: Noriaki Sato [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Noriaki Sato <nori@hgc.jp>
Description: Differential abundance analysis for microbiome count
    data using a compositionality-aware, bias-corrected negative-binomial
    model, empirical Bayes shrinkage, two-part prevalence inference, and a
    group-blind information filter.
